@baseUrl = http://localhost:5256

### ============================================================
### Auth — run first. Access token lives 15 min: re-run on 401.
### ============================================================

### Dev sign-in (Development only)
# @name dev
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev

### ============================================================
### GetMe
### ============================================================

### Current user — expect 200 with id, displayName, email, avatarUrl, createdAt (dev user: Dev User, dev@localhost)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{dev.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### No token — expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### ============================================================
### GetMyStats
### ============================================================

### Counts by status — expect 200; every status key present, missing ones as 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{dev.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### No token — expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/stats
